# Copy to secrets.properties (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# The engine REQUIRES this file to exist and SECRETS_FILE_PATH to point at it,
# even when you have no secrets - see AutomationConfigPropertiesLoader#loadSecretsFileProperties.
#
# Keys prefixed SECRET_VAR_ land in am.config UndefinedConfig and are masked in reports.
# Example:
# SECRET_VAR_STANDARD_USER_PASSWORD=changeme
